      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph A\n        A1[\"1\"]\n        A2[\"2\"]\n        A3[\"3\"]\n        A4[\"...\"]\n        A5[\"n\"]\n    end\n    subgraph B\n        B1[\"1\"]\n        B2[\"3\"]\n        B3[\"5\"]\n        B4[\"...\"]\n        B5[\"2n - 1\"]\n    end\n    A1 --> B1\n    A2 --> B2\n    A3 --> B3\n    A4 --> B4\n    A5 --> B5\n```",
